      "date": "2026-10-14 20:15:54.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\ndyntest evidence for this change: what sanity test_17h was meant to check, why it could not fail before (OBD_FAIL_MDS_LOV_PREP_CREATE has no CFS_FAIL_CHECK site), the eBPF traces from the MDS, and the run with this patch applied, in which the fail point fired in lod_declare_striped_create() and the test passed.\n\nReport (one HTML file, download and open in a browser; no server needed):\nhttps://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/attachment/67003/dyntest-sanity-17h-patch93.html\n\nAll dyntest test fixes are collected under LU-20966.",
